    "note": "Snapshot of the type ramp: the shared typography/line-height/* ladder, and each rung's size and line-height in both scripts with the ladder variable it binds. Values are identical across the five weights of every rung. Figma is the source of truth; packages/fasla-ui/tailwind-preset.ts mirrors this file and tokens/typography.test.ts asserts they agree. The ladder steps by 2px per half step from `L-0` (16), so the 14px rung below it is `L-neg-0,5`. Every style binds its line-height to a ladder variable and its family to `typography/font-family/{LTR,RTL}/font-family-default`. The one binding outside `typography/font-size/*` is deliberate: 4XL binds size to the 💻 Responsive `font-size` variable — 36 on Web, 30 on Tablet, 24 on Mobile — and this file records the Web value, which is what the preset declares."
  },
